AGY_ADC_AUTH AGY_ACCOUNT AGY_ERROR AGY_CLI_OSC7501 AGY_CLI_OSC7501_MESSAGES AGY_CLI_THEME
AGY_CLI_MAC_OPTION_AS_ALT AGY_CLI_HIDE_LOGO AGY_CLI_HIDE_ACCOUNT_INFO AGY_CLI_DISABLE_LATEX
AGY_CLI_DISABLE_ESCAPE_SEQUENCE_OPTIMIZATIONS AGY_CLI_CMD_OUTPUT_PERCENTAGE AGY_CLI_CDE_AUTH_ACTION
AGY_CLI_AUTO_COMPACT_OVERRIDE AGY_CDE_SEAMLESS_AUTH AGY_BUSINESS_PAYGO_TIER
ANTIGRAVITY_AGENTAPI_EXE ANTIGRAVITY_CONFIG_REL_DIR ANTIGRAVITY_CONVERSATION_ID ANTIGRAVITY_CSRF_TOKEN
ANTIGRAVITY_DISABLE_EMBEDDED_RIPGREP ANTIGRAVITY_EXECUTABLE_DATA_DIR ANTIGRAVITY_LS_ADDRESS
ANTIGRAVITY_PERM_GRANTS ANTIGRAVITY_PROJECT_ID ANTIGRAVITY_SIDECAR_UI_TOKEN ANTIGRAVITY_SIDECAR_WEB_PORT
Also read: GEMINI_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, GOOGLE_GEMINI_BASE_URL, GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_VERTEXAI, NO_COLOR.
None of them turns off the auto-updater or moves the state root.
